<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>性能指标 - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%87/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%87/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>性能指标--并发用户数（Concurrent Users）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/performance-index-concurrent-users/</link><pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2013 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/performance-index-concurrent-users/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;并发用户数&lt;/strong&gt;是指：在某一时间点，与被测目标系统同时进行交互的客户端用户的数量。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;并发用户数有以下几种含义：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="并发虚拟用户数concurrent-virtual-usersusers_cvu"&gt;&lt;span&gt;并发虚拟用户数（Concurrent Virtual Users，Users_CVU）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%b9%b6%e5%8f%91%e8%99%9a%e6%8b%9f%e7%94%a8%e6%88%b7%e6%95%b0concurrent-virtual-usersusers_cvu" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;在使用专用的测试工具（如Loadrunner、Jmeter）时用于模拟客户端用户的进程或线程的数量；该参数是针对&lt;em&gt;客户端&lt;/em&gt;（generator）而言的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>